{"5002430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CATENA - Chapter I", "steam_appid": 5002430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One body divided. Two players united.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Work in Progress – Not Representative of Final Quality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An asymmetric couch co-op where survival means working as one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive rift has torn reality apart. The sorcerer <strong>TABES</strong> strikes on two fronts at once:  the Physical Realm and the Astral Plane. To fight back, the echo <strong>CATENA</strong> splits her body in two. Bound by a chain, both players share <strong>one life pool</strong> and <strong>one weapon.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your character:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>The Physical Catena (Player 1)</strong>: pure will to live, courage, near-naive optimism. She matches the brutal rhythm of the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>The Astral Catena (Player 2)</strong>: the sum of her suppressed fears. Cynical, pessimistic, questions every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Asymmetric Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armored husks only take damage in the real world / spirits must be banished on the astral plane. Fight mirrored enemy hordes together - every hit demands coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/a39963803b4ebe5c0ff05a8849e17724.poster.avif?t=1785255055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/a39963803b4ebe5c0ff05a8849e17724.webm?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/a39963803b4ebe5c0ff05a8849e17724.mp4?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔄 The Weapon Toss</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss the single sword between players to swap roles instantly: one fights with melee combos, the other protects with tactical wind control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/52f269ff1b8e63c341cb4d50804992fe.poster.avif?t=1785255055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/52f269ff1b8e63c341cb4d50804992fe.webm?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/52f269ff1b8e63c341cb4d50804992fe.mp4?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏄 Windsurfing &amp; Platforming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide at high speed across open fields and time your jumps on crumbling rocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/b9438f9448d1e64ec20e6405c03becd4.poster.avif?t=1785255055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/b9438f9448d1e64ec20e6405c03becd4.webm?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/b9438f9448d1e64ec20e6405c03becd4.mp4?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗿 Runestones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate ancient, humming stones for a lasting healing aura - your anchor point mid-fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Ktonia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step out of the cave into a vast, wind-swept world where the ancestors speak through runestones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/b1658eafdf667923718fe414517ea7fa.poster.avif?t=1785255055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/b1658eafdf667923718fe414517ea7fa.webm?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/b1658eafdf667923718fe414517ea7fa.mp4?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot with Impact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen enemies drop powerful boosts: <strong>Shield</strong>, <strong>Time Slow</strong>, and <strong>Score Multiplier</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/982f4fa916717c3ded0274829d4296a8.poster.avif?t=1785255055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/982f4fa916717c3ded0274829d4296a8.webm?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/982f4fa916717c3ded0274829d4296a8.mp4?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Team &amp; the Project</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by <strong>Team Mouseworks</strong> (5 students) in 3 months at HNU as a fifth-semester project, and showcased at <strong>Gamescom 2026</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One body divided. Two players united.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Work in Progress – Not Representative of Final Quality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An asymmetric couch co-op where survival means working as one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive rift has torn reality apart. The sorcerer <strong>TABES</strong> strikes on two fronts at once:  the Physical Realm and the Astral Plane. To fight back, the echo <strong>CATENA</strong> splits her body in two. Bound by a chain, both players share <strong>one life pool</strong> and <strong>one weapon.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your character:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>The Physical Catena (Player 1)</strong>: pure will to live, courage, near-naive optimism. She matches the brutal rhythm of the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>The Astral Catena (Player 2)</strong>: the sum of her suppressed fears. Cynical, pessimistic, questions every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Asymmetric Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armored husks only take damage in the real world / spirits must be banished on the astral plane. Fight mirrored enemy hordes together - every hit demands coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/a39963803b4ebe5c0ff05a8849e17724.poster.avif?t=1785255055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/a39963803b4ebe5c0ff05a8849e17724.webm?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/a39963803b4ebe5c0ff05a8849e17724.mp4?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔄 The Weapon Toss</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss the single sword between players to swap roles instantly: one fights with melee combos, the other protects with tactical wind control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/52f269ff1b8e63c341cb4d50804992fe.poster.avif?t=1785255055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/52f269ff1b8e63c341cb4d50804992fe.webm?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/52f269ff1b8e63c341cb4d50804992fe.mp4?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏄 Windsurfing &amp; Platforming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide at high speed across open fields and time your jumps on crumbling rocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/b9438f9448d1e64ec20e6405c03becd4.poster.avif?t=1785255055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/b9438f9448d1e64ec20e6405c03becd4.webm?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/b9438f9448d1e64ec20e6405c03becd4.mp4?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗿 Runestones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate ancient, humming stones for a lasting healing aura - your anchor point mid-fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Ktonia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step out of the cave into a vast, wind-swept world where the ancestors speak through runestones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/b1658eafdf667923718fe414517ea7fa.poster.avif?t=1785255055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/b1658eafdf667923718fe414517ea7fa.webm?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/b1658eafdf667923718fe414517ea7fa.mp4?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot with Impact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen enemies drop powerful boosts: <strong>Shield</strong>, <strong>Time Slow</strong>, and <strong>Score Multiplier</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/982f4fa916717c3ded0274829d4296a8.poster.avif?t=1785255055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/982f4fa916717c3ded0274829d4296a8.webm?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002430/extras/982f4fa916717c3ded0274829d4296a8.mp4?t=1785255055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Team &amp; the Project</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by <strong>Team Mouseworks</strong> (5 students) in 3 months at HNU as a fifth-semester project, and showcased at <strong>Gamescom 2026</strong>.</p>", "short_description": "CATENA is a co-op action-adventure about two players chained together,